ipv4rule from guest to wan srcip 0.0.0.0/0 dstip 0.0.0.0/0 action drop log info prior 7
ipv6rule from lan to dmz srcip ::/0 dstip ::/0 action drop log info prior 7
ipv6rule from lan to wan srcip ::/0 dstip ::/0 action drop log info prior 7
ipv6rule from lan to guest srcip ::/0 dstip ::/0 action drop log info prior 7
ipv6rule from dmz to lan srcip ::/0 dstip ::/0 action drop log info prior 7
