ipv6rule from wan to dmz srcip ::/0 dstip ::/0 action drop log info prior 7
ipv6rule from wan to guest srcip ::/0 dstip ::/0 action drop log info prior 7
ipv6rule from guest to lan srcip ::/0 dstip ::/0 action drop log info prior 7
ipv6rule from guest to dmz srcip ::/0 dstip ::/0 action drop log info prior 7
ipv6rule from guest to wan srcip ::/0 dstip ::/0 action drop log info prior 7
ipv4rule from lan to dmz srcip 0.0.0.0/0 dstip 0.0.0.0/0 action drop log no prior 8
ipv6rule from lan to dmz srcip ::/0 dstip ::/0 action drop log no prior 8
ipv4rule from lan to wan srcip 0.0.0.0/0 dstip 0.0.0.0/0 action drop log no prior 8
ipv6rule from lan to wan srcip ::/0 dstip ::/0 action drop log no prior 8
ipv4rule from lan to guest srcip 0.0.0.0/0 dstip 0.0.0.0/0 action drop log no prior 8
